OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F311A1787363309
OL,3,CFifa sacks senior executive after
OL,4,Ccriticism of Gianni Infantino
OL,6,FFifa's chief operating officer Kevin
OL,7,FLamour has been sacked weeks after he
OL,8,Fclaimed Gianni Infantino's
OL,9,Fcontroversial plan to invite private
OL,10,Finvestors into the World Cup had
OL,11,F"deceived" administration at the
OL,12,Fgoverning body.
OL,14,FLamour's dismissal was confirmed on
OL,15,FMonday in the latest domino effect of
OL,16,FInfantino's proposal to sell stakes in
OL,17,Fa company to run the World Cup and
OL,18,Fother tournaments to private investors.
OL,26,@sD@AOUsD@JO]
