OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F311A1787363309
OL,3,CFifa sacks senior executive after
OL,4,Ccriticism of Gianni Infantino
OL,6,FThe proposal was rejected by three
OL,7,Fcontinental confederations and led to
OL,8,FUEFA's threat to boycott all Fifa
OL,9,Fcompetitions until the plans were
OL,10,Fshelved.
OL,12,FDuring the infancy of the crisis,
OL,13,FLamour told the Associated Press that
OL,14,FFifa's administration had been
OL,15,F"deceived" by Infantino.
OL,17,FThe Swiss Fifa president remains under
OL,18,Fextreme pressure after three
OL,19,Fconfederation presidents accused him
OL,20,Fof "deception" in an open letter
OL,21,Fpublished last week.
OL,26,@wD@AOUwD@JO]|D@DOU|D@NO]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/10
