OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F311A1787363309
OL,3,CFifa sacks senior executive after
OL,4,Ccriticism of Gianni Infantino
OL,6,F"Fifa can confirm that the working
OL,7,Frelationship between Fifa and Kevin
OL,8,FLamour as Fifa's Chief Operating
OL,9,FOfficer has ended on 17 August 2026,"
OL,10,Fa spokesperson said.
OL,12,F"Fifa thanks Kevin for his two years
OL,13,Fof service and wishes him the best of
OL,14,Fluck for the future. No further
OL,15,Fcomment will be made on the matter."
OL,17,FLamour's exit occurred on the same day
OL,18,FInfantino lost the support of the
OL,19,FScottish Football Association, it is
OL,20,Funderstood.
OL,26,@nD@AOUqD@eO]tD@AOUwD@dO]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/10
