OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F311A1787363309
OL,3,CFifa sacks senior executive after
OL,4,Ccriticism of Gianni Infantino
OL,6,FThe governing body's chief executive
OL,7,FIan Maxwell said on Monday: "The
OL,8,FScottish FA will not be voting for
OL,9,FGianni Infantino. That's in line with
OL,10,Fthe UEFA position and we've maintained
OL,11,Fthat stance throughout.
OL,13,F"When you're an administrator in
OL,14,Ffootball, you shouldn't be anywhere
OL,15,Fnear the camera anywhere near as often
OL,16,Fas has been the case.
OL,26,@oD@]OUuD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/10
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
