OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F311A1787363309
OL,3,CFifa sacks senior executive after
OL,4,Ccriticism of Gianni Infantino
OL,6,F"Something has gone wrong if the focus
OL,7,Fafter the most successful, the most
OL,8,Fwell-supported World Cup, that every
OL,9,FScotland fan who was there will be
OL,10,Ftalking about for the rest of their
OL,11,Flives, has now become off-the-field
OL,12,Fincidents rather than on the field.
OL,14,F"That can't be where football should
OL,15,Fbe. It's got to be focused on the game
OL,16,Fitself and on the relationship with
OL,17,Fthe fans.
OL,26,@nD@AOUvD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/10
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
