PN,31106
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F311A1787363309
OL,3,CFifa sacks senior executive after
OL,4,Ccriticism of Gianni Infantino
OL,6,F"There's obviously been a fall-down in
OL,7,Fgovernance, there's been a lack of
OL,8,Ftransparency, there's been a lack of
OL,9,Fengagement with member associations,
OL,10,Fand that's something that we need to
OL,11,Faddress. The transparency and the
OL,12,Fgovernance needs to change."
OL,14,FThe SFA's president, Mike Mulraney, is
OL,15,Fthe current chair of Fifa's finance
OL,16,Fcommittee.
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@\O]
