OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F311A1787363309
OL,3,CFifa sacks senior executive after
OL,4,Ccriticism of Gianni Infantino
OL,6,FPressure on Infantino continues to
OL,7,Fmount and PA understands the intent of
OL,8,Fan open letter which accused Fifa's
OL,9,Fpresident of deception last week was
OL,10,Fto give him the opportunity to resign.
OL,12,FIf Infantino refuses to resign, one
OL,13,Foption for his opponents could be to
OL,14,Ffind a candidate willing to stand
OL,15,Fagainst him in next year's Congress.
OL,17,FHowever, advocacy group FairSquare is
OL,18,Fcalling for a different approach and
OL,19,Fhas written to Fifa questioning
OL,20,FInfantino's right to even stand for re-
OL,21,Felection.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G7/10
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
