OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F311A1787363309
OL,3,CFifa sacks senior executive after
OL,4,Ccriticism of Gianni Infantino
OL,6,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,7,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,8,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,9,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,11,FBefore the 2022 World Cup final, a
OL,12,FFifa said its governing council agreed
OL,13,Fwith its governance, audit and
OL,14,Fcompliance committee (GACC) that
OL,15,FInfantino's reign between 2016 and
OL,16,F2019 ` when he succeeded Sepp Blatter
OL,17,Fat an Extraordinary Congress ` did not
OL,18,Fcount toward the maximum three-term
OL,19,Flimit set out in Article 33.2 of the
OL,20,FFifa Statutes.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G8/10
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
