OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F311A1787363309
OL,3,CFifa sacks senior executive after
OL,4,Ccriticism of Gianni Infantino
OL,6,FFairSquare was supported in its letter
OL,7,Fby Miguel Maduro, the former chair of
OL,8,FFifa's governance committee, who said
OL,9,Fon Monday: "2027 would be his election
OL,10,Ffor a fourth term of office, and it
OL,11,Fseems to me that the wording of the
OL,12,Fprovision runs clearly against that."
OL,14,FFairSquare's letter has been sent to
OL,15,FFifa's review committee, which is a
OL,16,Fsub-committee of the GACC and is
OL,17,Fempowered to make decisions on the
OL,18,Feligibility of presidential candidates.
OL,26,@qD@LOUtD@eO]
