OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F311A1787363309
OL,3,CFifa sacks senior executive after
OL,4,Ccriticism of Gianni Infantino
OL,6,FMaduro said: "I'm still hopeful that
OL,7,Fat least some members of the review
OL,8,Fcommittee will not accept to be part
OL,9,Fof what I think will be a charade if
OL,10,Fthey consider him eligible, and in
OL,11,Faddition to that I hope that the
OL,12,Ffootball associations that oppose him
OL,13,Fmake this the central point."
